Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Heart Knot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 11
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.47,0:00:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, with heavy hearts,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,we announce the devastating news
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,that His Majesty the King and His Highness Prince Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,have been eaten by the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Even the Prince was eaten?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s over. The Bulala Kingdom is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t panic everyone, Master Quan is still here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The future of Bulala Kingdom is guarded by Master Quan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:01:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He will never let anyone be harmed by monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Please believe in Master Quan and support Master Quan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.01,0:01:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Quan the New King
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.73,0:01:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we support Master Quan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.93,0:01:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I support Master Quan to become the new King
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,With Master Quan here, we don’t have to be afraid of the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,With Master Quan as the King, our Bulala Kingdom will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,King Quan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.72,0:01:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,King Quan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,support King Quan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,King Quan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.56,0:01:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,King Quan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,King Quan King Quan King Quan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.99,0:01:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have some value, I can’t deal with you now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.87,0:01:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I did a lot of bad embroidery and Father scolded me for wasting Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.07,0:02:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay to waste some Bulala on something you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.15,0:02:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you are
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Use with confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.83,0:02:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle supports you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Uncle. I will support you in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.14,0:02:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you would understand me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect you to be like him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear brother, I won this time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on I am the new King of Bulala Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:03:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is decided by me and all Bulala belong to me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,we are still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,we are indeed alive
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.15,0:03:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But it ate us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you actually eating us to save us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.59,0:03:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.87,0:03:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,These must have been done by Uncle again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But where did such a big Little Cutie come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no such monster in our world
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know what day I jumped out of the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out you also came from the rifts
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.71,0:04:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,go home
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, we also come from the world on the other side of the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you leaving now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have one more important thing to do
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be resolved before going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is only our—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.43,0:04:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t forget that we are partners
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.07,0:04:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we help our partners when they are in trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to help too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so touched
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.97,0:04:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But the strange power in Uncle’s body is too strong
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We are no match for him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.87,0:04:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it’s not like there’s no way at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.54,0:05:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The King arrives
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful and long robe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So beautiful, so luxurious
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, our Bulala has been confiscated
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does the King still have so many Bulala?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was made into such a long and beautiful robe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,From today on I am your new King
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, everyone must diligently offer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster, monster
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster, run away, help
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, run away
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.49,0:06:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve already handed over Bulala, so why is the monster still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there’s someone on top of the monster
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.77,0:06:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.24,0:06:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,that is
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the King and Prince Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren’t you eaten by the monster? Why are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.60,0:06:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not a monster, it’s obviously a docile Little Cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:06:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you are colluding with the monster
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.97,0:07:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch them quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, you use the monster to create panic
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the opportunity to collect everyone’s Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, everything is to satisfy your own selfish desires
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You have never thought about your people at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out that we collected Bulala day and night
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to satisfy his selfish desires
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.32,0:07:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you don’t deserve it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t go there, everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can win with more people?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the powerful can win
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the powerful can win
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the powerful can win
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.92,0:07:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t hurt them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dare to confront me head-on, overestimating your own abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, it’s too late to stop now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.51,0:08:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking nonsense
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,caught
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.31,0:08:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, I’m sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.15,0:08:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Only by grasping your Heart Knot can we prevent you from making mistakes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We Bulala people all have a core called Heart Knot
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This core is our weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But everyone’s Heart Knot is in different locations
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where his Heart Knot is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So despicable
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.79,0:08:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, pull back from the brink and look back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s disgusting that you win every time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Give you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Give you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.88,0:09:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.49,0:09:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You are too extravagant and wasteful. You see your brother is very frugal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re wrong, it’s you, it’s you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we quarreling again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no overnight feud between brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, if you encounter a problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,just let it sit overnight
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and solve it together tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.97,0:10:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This trial is very simple
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever finds the best Bulala will inherit the throne
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, I found the biggest Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The biggest is the best
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you find?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I found Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.19,0:10:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Bulala. Isn’t that a legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.67,0:10:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t find Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I really found it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.03,0:10:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Brother
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.02,0:10:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that? This is Golden Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous. This is not Golden Bulala at all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not convinced
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.55,0:10:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you get the throne and the robes and not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.94,0:10:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,unfair
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I also made a robe myself
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.51,0:11:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I found out that Bulala can calm the monster
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to offer Bulala regularly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it will make life difficult for residents
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.31,0:11:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided to tame it myself
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Be good, we are good people too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, this monster has been tamed by me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.86,0:11:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We can tell everyone that we don’t have to be afraid anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Can’t let you succeed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.46,0:11:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Very docile
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The King is mighty The King is wise
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.81,0:12:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you understand my Heart Knot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t even know what my Heart Knot is about
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
